      "name": "WARREN BURGER",
      "text": "In 73-1210, Interstate Commerce Commission against Oregon Pacific Industries, I have an opinion to announce on behalf of Mr. Justice Douglas. And for reasons stated in the opinion written by Mr. Justice Douglas and filed today, the judgment of the United States District Court for the District of Oregon is reversed. Mr. Justice Powell filed a concurring opinion.",
